---
const RELEASES = 'https://github.com/safiware/archdraw/releases/latest';
import InstallCommand from './InstallCommand.astro';
const dl = '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v12m0 0l-5-5m5 5l5-5M4 20h16"/></svg>';
---
<section class="band alt" id="get" aria-labelledby="g-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow"><b>07</b> Download</p>
    <h2 class="sec-h" id="g-h">Get archdraw.</h2>
    <div class="get-grid">
      <div class="card dl-card">
        <h3>Install</h3>
        <p>One command for both systems: it picks the build for your machine, checks it against the release's checksums, and installs it.</p>
        <InstallCommand />
        <ul class="plat" aria-label="Supported systems">
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16.37 12.62c-.02-2.21 1.8-3.27 1.88-3.32-1.03-1.5-2.62-1.71-3.19-1.73-1.36-.14-2.65.8-3.34.8-.69 0-1.75-.78-2.88-.76-1.48.02-2.85.86-3.61 2.19-1.54 2.67-.39 6.62 1.11 8.79.73 1.06 1.6 2.25 2.74 2.21 1.1-.04 1.52-.71 2.85-.71 1.33 0 1.71.71 2.88.69 1.19-.02 1.94-1.08 2.66-2.15.84-1.23 1.19-2.42 1.2-2.48-.03-.01-2.3-.88-2.3-3.53ZM14.18 6.13c.6-.73 1.01-1.75.9-2.76-.87.04-1.92.58-2.55 1.31-.56.65-1.05 1.69-.92 2.68.97.08 1.96-.49 2.57-1.23Z"/></svg><strong>Mac</strong> macOS 13+, Apple Silicon or Intel</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="m7 9 2.5 2L7 13M12 13h4M9 20h6"/></svg><strong>Linux</strong> x64, .deb or AppImage</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="dl-alt"><a href="https://github.com/safiware/archdraw/blob/main/site/public/install.sh">Read the script</a> · <a href={RELEASES}><Fragment set:html={dl} />Or download the files</a> · <a href="https://github.com/safiware/archdraw/blob/main/docs/install-mac.md">Opening a downloaded .dmg</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="card biz">
        <p class="eyebrow">For your business</p>
        <h3>Want archdraw inside your company?</h3>
        <p>We set it up in-house, on your servers and connected to your repos and AI models, and help your team put AI to work across engineering.</p>
        <div class="biz-act">
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="mailto:hello@archdraw.dev?subject=archdraw%20for%20our%20team"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2.5"/><path d="m4 7 8 6 8-6"/></svg>Talk to us</a>
          <span class="mono biz-mail">hello@archdraw.dev</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="get-note">Works with GitHub repos, checked on your schedule, and local folders, drawn when you ask. Needs git, and the GitHub CLI for pull requests.</p>
      <div class="card cloud">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">What’s next</p>
          <p class="next"><span class="live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Next in the app:</strong> a change log for every diagram, showing which commits changed it.</span></p>
          <h3>archdraw Cloud, later</h3>
          <p>Watches while your laptop is closed. Share links. AI included. Follow the releases to hear first.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cloud-act">
          <a class="btn btn-lamp" href="https://github.com/safiware/archdraw/releases"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 12S6 5.5 12 5.5 21.5 12 21.5 12 18 18.5 12 18.5 2.5 12 2.5 12Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>Watch releases on GitHub</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .get-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: clamp(28px, 5vh, 48px); }
  .card { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .card h3 { font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 720; }
  .card p:not(.eyebrow) { color: var(--text-2); font-size: .96rem; }
  .card > .btn { align-self: flex-start; margin-top: auto; }
  .dl-card { grid-column: span 2; gap: 12px; }
  .dl-card .install-cmd { margin-top: 2px; }
  .dl-card .install-cmd code { font-size: .84rem; }
  .plat { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .plat li { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 5px 11px; border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 999px; font-size: .86rem; color: var(--text-2); }
  .plat strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 650; }
  .plat svg { width: 15px; height: 15px; flex: none; color: var(--text); }
  .dl-alt { font-size: .88rem; }
  .dl-alt a { color: var(--signal); text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .dl-alt svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; vertical-align: -2px; margin-right: 4px; }
  .card.biz { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--rule) 55%, var(--lamp) 45%); }
  .biz-act { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px 14px; margin-top: auto; }
  .biz-mail { color: var(--text-2); font-size: .82rem; user-select: all; }
  .get-note { grid-column: 1 / -1; margin: 0; color: var(--text-2); font-size: .95rem; }
  .card.cloud { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 16px 32px; align-items: center; background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--panel), color-mix(in srgb, var(--panel) 80%, var(--signal) 20%)); }
  .cloud h3 { margin-top: 18px; }
  .cloud p:not(.eyebrow) { margin-top: 8px; }
  .card.cloud .next { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; color: var(--text); }
  .cloud .next .live-dot { flex: none; margin-top: .55em; }
  .cloud-act { display: grid; gap: 14px; justify-items: start; }
  @media (min-width: 961px) { .cloud-act { justify-items: end; } }
  @media (max-width: 960px) { .get-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } .dl-card { grid-column: auto; } .card.cloud { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
</style>

